+- A consent record is never changed or deleted; a new decision appends a record. The current decision is the latest record per person and purpose (T3-AC-004).
 - At most one ERP customer number per person (T3-AC-003).
 - ERP master data comes through the `integration` module, never from the ERP port.
 
